    "q-66798": {
      "dom_id": "step-q66798",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$\\operatorname{ln}⁡10≈2.303$ is equivalent to",
      "worked_solution": "The natural logarithm of $a$ is defined as follows:\n\n$\\operatorname{ln}⁡a=x$ is equivalent to $a={e}^{x}$\n\nIf we compare $\\operatorname{ln}⁡10≈2.303$ with $\\operatorname{ln}⁡a=x,$ we get $a=10$ and $x=2.303.$\n\nTherefore, the approximation $\\operatorname{ln}⁡10≈2.303$ is equivalent to ${e}^{2.303}≈10.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
