    "q-23114": {
      "dom_id": "step-q23114",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "Rounded to $3$ decimal places,  $\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)=$",
      "worked_solution": "We compute the required expression to $3$ decimal places using a calculator, rounding the intermediate steps to $6$ decimal places to avoid rounding error. This gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3) & ≈0.693\\,147+1.098\\,612 \\\\  & ≈1.791\\,759 \\\\  & ≈1.792\\end{aligned}\n$$",
